  "done": {
    "public_acceptance": [
      {
        "id": "A1",
        "predicate": "захардененные workflow с новыми jobs, Dependabot, CODEOWNERS, zizmor-конфиг; Completion Notes: число\npinned actions, список новых jobs, zizmor findings до/после, review; в Phase Handoff — запрос O-3 (push + ссылка на run).",
        "scope": "public",
        "check": "- `bash -c 'uses=$(grep -hE \"^\\s*-?\\s*uses: \" .github/workflows/*.yml) || exit 1; bad=$(printf \"%s\\n\" \"$uses\" | grep -vcE \"@[0-9a-f]{40} # v?[0-9]\"); rc=$?; printf \"%s\\n\" \"$bad\"; test \"$rc\" -le 1 && test \"$bad\" -eq 0'` → `0`, exit 0; неполный pin или ошибка чтения → exit 1.\n- `grep -L \"^permissions: {}\" .github/workflows/*.yml` → пусто; `grep -c \"persist-credentials: false\" .github/workflows/*.yml`\n  = числу `actions/checkout` в каждом файле.\n- `build/tools/venv/bin/zizmor --offline .github/workflows` → exit 0.\n- `build/tools/venv/bin/python -c \"import yaml,glob;[yaml.safe_load(open(f)) for f in glob.glob('.github/**/*.yml',recursive=True)]\"` → exit 0.\n- `bash -c 'if grep -nE \"[[:punct:]]8\\.3[[:punct:]]|Boxed profile\" .github/workflows/*.yml; then exit 1; else test \"$?\" -eq 1; fi'` → пусто, exit 0; устаревшая матрица/шаг или ошибка чтения → exit 1; `grep -n \"matrix.postgres\" .github/workflows/ci.yml` → ≥1.\n- `grep -c \"composer audit --locked\" .github/workflows/ci.yml` ≥ числа шагов `composer update|install` в ci.yml.\n- Локальный эквивалент новых jobs зелёный: `python3 scripts/manifest-check.py`, `scripts/php84 composer golden`,\n  `scripts/php84 php scripts/ownership-gate.php`, `scripts/php84 composer analyse`, `scripts/php84 bash scripts/dependency-analyser.sh --all`,\n  `scripts/php84 composer audit --locked` → exit 0 каждый.\n- `bash scripts/anti-weakening-gate.sh` → exit 0.\n- Independent review: reviewer/effort — из строки `roadmap.md` `execution-sheet/v1`; свежий контекст, reviewer model !=\n  executor; вход — item-spec + diff + вывод Validation; строка `review: <provider>/<model> <GREEN|findings:N>`; ≤2 раунда.\n- Live CI — не acceptance item: владелец пушит (O-3), результат — Phase Validation.",
        "evidence_ref": "E15"
      }
